    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton's iconic Trunk family welcomes a new member this season: the**Vanity Pouch Trunk**. The designer cleverly merges a cosmetic pouch with a hard-sided trunk, using a horizontal silhouette to create a structured makeup bag look, complete with metal corner guards and rivets. The body is crafted from Monogram Reverse canvas, while the flap features the classic Monogram canvas. It includes a top handle, a detachable shoulder strap, and a metal chain for versatile wear.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
